{"articleNo":"324054","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=324054&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[수업] 2021-2 폐강과목 안내 및 수강정정신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2021.09.07","hit":"14407","attachments":[{"name":"2021-2학기_폐강대상강좌_내역(공지용).xlsx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=324054&attachNo=104297"},{"name":"폐강과목+수강정정신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=324054&attachNo=104298"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"\"><b><font face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">2021-2 폐강과목 안내 및 수강 정정신청 안내</span></font><br></b></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">2021-2</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">학기 폐강과목을 붙임과&nbsp;같이 공고하오니 대상과목을 수강 신청한 학생은 다른 과목으로 수강정정 기간 내에 변경하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">1.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">정정신청기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">:&nbsp;2021. 9. 8.(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">), 10:00</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">부터</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">&nbsp;~&nbsp; 9. 9.(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">), 18:00</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">까지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">&nbsp;(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">승인</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: 9. 8. ~ 9. 10.)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">정정신청 가능 대상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><u><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;color:#0900ff;\">폐강된 과목에</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;color:#0900ff;\">&nbsp;</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;color:#0900ff;\">수강 신청한 학생만 정정 신청 기간 수강신청 가능</span></u></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">3.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">정정방법</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">신청할 과목에</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">여석이 없을 경우</span><br> <span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; “</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\"><b>원스톱서비스</b></span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;mso-hansi-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">→</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">학사관리</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;mso-hansi-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">→</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">수강신청</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;mso-hansi-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">→</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">수강신청 변경 및 정정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">”</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">에서 수강 정정신청</span><br> <span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;mso-hansi-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">※</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">신청 전 반드시 수강가능여부를 확인할것</span><br> <span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">신청할 과목에</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">여석이 있을 경우</span><br> <span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">붙임의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">&nbsp;“</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\"><b>폐강과목 수강정정 신청서</b></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">[붙임2&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">서식</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">]”</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">를 작성하여</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">교무처로 제출</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(</span><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">gmg0416@kumoh.ac.kr</span></u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">4.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">유의사항</span><br> <span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">본인이 신청한 과목 중 폐강 된 과목 수 만큼만 변경이 가능합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">.</span><br> <span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">정정한 과목에 대해서는 수업시간에 반드시 출석부 확인을 하여야 합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;font-family:Noto;mso-ascii-font-family:Noto;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">붙임</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 2021-2</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">학기 합반</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">분반 및 폐강대상 강좌내역</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">&nbsp;1</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">부.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">폐강과목 수강정정신청서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;fo